              "height": 4.667467948717949,
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h5 style=\"font-family:'Project Chinese Regular', sans-serif;font-weight:400;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-transform:uppercase;font-size:3.589744vw;line-height:4.666667vw;letter-spacing:0.107692vw\">「 奢華與品味的故事 」</h5>",
              "text": "「 奢華與品味的故事 」",
