              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2 style=\"font-family:'Project Chinese Bold', sans-serif;font-weight:400;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-transform:uppercase;font-size:6.410231vw;line-height:8.333308vw;letter-spacing:1.282046vw\"><span style=\"font-family:'Project Chinese Bold', sans-serif;font-weight:400;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-transform:uppercase;font-size:6.410231vw;line-height:8.333308vw;letter-spacing:1.282046vw\"><span style=\"font-family:'Project Chinese Regular', sans-serif;font-weight:400;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-transform:uppercase;font-size:6.410231vw;line-height:8.333308vw;letter-spacing:1.282046vw\">資訊科技室</span><span style=\"font-family:'Project Chinese Light', sans-serif;font-weight:400;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-transform:uppercase;font-size:6.410231vw;line-height:8.333308vw;letter-spacing:1.282046vw\">|</span><br/>\n聖博德天主教小學<br/>\n(蒲崗村道)</span></h2>",
